{"id":"vod_sn_36454","vodId":"36454","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"少年女仆","name_cn":"少年女仆","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/e510ff19605fe40f95e63c5d13fa22ea.jpg"},"summary":"小宫千寻（藤原夏海 配音）从小和母亲过着相依为命的生活，母亲不擅家事，家中的洒扫洗涮便都由千寻来承担，日子虽然过得拮据艰辛，但却十分的幸福快乐。然而，不幸忽然降临，母亲过世，千寻失去了最后的依靠。　　鹰取圆（岛崎信长 配音）是千寻的舅舅，他收留了无处可去的千寻，让他免费住在自己的家中。可是，这一举动却激怒了千寻，因为他深信工作是人生的唯一信条，只有靠工作换来的成果才能够心安理得的享用。鹰取圆是一位小有名气的服装设计师，然而生活中，却是个什么都不懂邋里邋遢的懒鬼。对于眼前的脏乱差实在看不下去的千寻开始着手收拾屋子，于是鹰取圆决定任命千寻为家中的“女仆”，用劳动换取学费和生活费。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:43:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kLdZdCae3e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DVz7qYDZF71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6V8Dn16q4Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zEKbdH725m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Fd0RHuaNiP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GB2NGDBfpT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rVf9eezhKV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/agdPjkf6kY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ayk2kiF7yr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/60uXUSf5801/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WXHCCMf0tf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nqxwgsBtCU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hsteb554eG1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:22.763Z"}